{"id":255,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Torchic has a place inside its body where it keeps its flame. Give it a hug—it will be glowing with warmth. This Pokémon is covered all over by a fluffy coat of down."},{"games":["Omega Ruby"],"text":"Torchic sticks with its Trainer, following behind with unsteady steps. This Pokémon breathes fire of over 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit, including fireballs that leave the foe scorched black."},{"games":["Y"],"text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Inside its body is a place where it keeps a small flame. Hug it! It will be as warm as a hot-water bottle."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"If attacked, it strikes back by spitting balls of fire it forms in its stomach. A TORCHIC dislikes darkness because it can’t see its surroundings."},{"games":["Ruby"],"text":"TORCHIC sticks with its TRAINER, following behind with unsteady steps. This POKéMON breathes fire of over 1,800 degrees F, including fireballs that leave the foe scorched black."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Speed Boost","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's Speed stat is boosted every turn."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Red","shape":"Legs","evolution":{"id":255,"name":"Torchic","condition":null,"children":[{"id":256,"name":"Combusken","condition":"Lv. 16","children":[{"id":257,"name":"Blaziken","condition":"Lv. 36","children":